# Files here are NOT uploaded as static assets.
#
# wrangler.toml sets pages_build_output_dir = ".", which makes the whole repo
# root the asset directory — so anything not excluded is downloadable from the
# live site. Wrangler has its own built-in ignore list, but it is undocumented
# and hard-coded, so the exclusions that matter are stated explicitly here.
#
# functions/ is deliberately absent: Pages compiles that directory into Workers
# rather than serving it, and excluding it risks breaking that build.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler
node_modules

# Applied to D1 with `wrangler d1 execute`, never served.
db
wrangler.toml
